window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>ONE-NIGHT STANDS: SHE’S DOING THEM WRONG</p> <p>Happy ever afters are for suckers, and Cat Keller is no sucker. After years of watching her mother go from marriage to marriage, heartbreak to heartbreak, she’s put a set of rules into place–never stay the night, never bring a boy home–to avoid the same fate.</p> <p>Then she meets radio deejay and local heartthrob Jude Oliver.</p> <p>One by one, Cat’s rules bend and break under Jude’s patience and persistence. Soon, only one rule remains: no falling in love. Can Cat keep the walls around her heart intact? Or will she face her biggest fears and allow herself to fall?</p>"; 
